{
  "id": "PSA.63",
  "number": "63",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 63",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "63",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 63"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "63",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of David, when he was in the wilderness of Judah.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O God, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God; early will I seek thee: my soul thirsteth for thee, my flesh longeth for thee in a dry and thirsty land, where no water is;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To see thy power and thy glory, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen thee in the sanctuary.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because thy lovingkindness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than life, my lips shall praise thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus will I bless thee while I live: I will lift up my hands in thy name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My soul shall be satisfied as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "marrow and fatness; and my mouth shall praise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thee",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with joyful lips:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I remember thee upon my bed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meditate on thee in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "night",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "watches.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because thou hast been my help, therefore in the shadow of thy wings will I rejoice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My soul followeth hard after thee: thy right hand upholdeth me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But those",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seek my soul, to destroy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.63.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.63.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", shall go into the lower parts of the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall fall by the sword: they shall be a portion for foxes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the king shall rejoice in God; every one that sweareth by him shall glory: but the mouth of them that speak lies shall be stopped.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.64",
    "number": "64",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.62",
    "number": "62",
